      "description" : "This data includes the processed structure factors for diffraction images collected on protein crystals relevant to the project, as well as the refined structural models.<div><br></div><div>The data will be deposited on the protein data bank (PDB, https://www.rcsb.org/). Data will be made accessible together with a pre-print manuscript pertinent to the project results.&#160;</div>",
